  "description": "A few months after the chaos of Goonya Monster, Snail finds herself stuck in a peaceful… but boring routine without her beloved battles.\nThat is, until a massive horde of undead suddenly appears right before her eyes!\n\nThis spin-off mini-game from Goonya Monster puts fan-favorite character Snail in the spotlight.\nBlast through waves of undead and race across stages that get faster and faster the longer you survive!\n\n◇ Simple controls!\nMove left and right to dodge obstacles and defeat incoming undead.\nEasy to pick up and play, with gameplay that’s fun for everyone—from kids to adults.\n\n◆ Lose all your life, and it’s game over!\nCrashing into enemies or tripping over obstacles will reduce your life.\nOnce it hits zero, the game is over!\n\n◆ The longer you last, the faster it gets!\nAs time passes, both Snail’s excitement and the stage speed ramp up.\nStay sharp and react quickly—don’t forget to give your eyes and brain a break!\n\n◆ Choose your weapon and fight your way!\nLaser, Gatling Gun, or Crossbow—the choice is yours.\nMaster each weapon’s unique traits to take down enemies efficiently!\nDefeated the undead that drops \"Souls\". Collect them to level up and power up your weapons!\n\n◆ Clear the way with bombs!\nWhen your bomb gauge is full, unleash a barrage of bombs with your skill button!\nWipe out enemies and obstacles in a flashy explosion and carve your path forward!\n\n◇ Battle mode (Local 2-player mode)\nIn this mode, Pirarucu joins the battle from Goonya Monster!\nSteal power-ups, tackle your opponent off the stage, and outgrow your rival before the boss fight!",
